/* 對話框 */
"Delete all clips?" = "刪除所有剪貼項目?";
"This removes every saved copy except sticky clips, clips marked Never Auto Delete and clips inside groups. It cannot be undone." = "將刪除所有已儲存的副本,但釘選項目、標記為「永不自動刪除」的項目以及群組內的項目不受影響。此操作無法復原。";
"Delete" = "刪除";
"Cancel" = "取消";
"Ditty needs the Accessibility permission to paste for you" = "Ditty 需要「輔助使用」權限才能代你貼上";
"The clip is on your clipboard, so you can press ⌘V yourself right now.\n\nTo let Ditty paste automatically, turn on Ditty under System Settings → Privacy & Security → Accessibility." = "剪貼內容已複製到剪貼簿,你現在可以直接按 ⌘V 貼上。\n\n若要讓 Ditty 自動貼上,請在 系統設定 → 隱私權與安全性 → 輔助使用 中開啟 Ditty。";
"Open System Settings" = "打開系統設定";
"Not Now" = "稍後再說";

